And then you'll just end up walking into an enemy and your health is just, like, bleeding.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:42.640
Yeah, yeah. You have that?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:53.360
I just feel like for that reason, for the reason you were describing about just no visual effect to the melee combat, it just feels like most of the time you should just be shooting projectiles.

